    <section id="about" aria-label="About me">
      <h2>About</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);max-width:70ch">
        I'm a developer and security-minded tinkerer who builds tools, automations, and interfaces.
        I enjoy taking complex systems and making them scriptable and observable. Replace this text
        with your bio, links to your GitHub, resume, or other highlights.
